## YC BRIEF — For Evaluators

**What is Bheem?**
Bheem is a personal AI performance coach built inside Claude Code that reads a founder's Whoop biometric data every day and delivers one actionable brief: your body's state, what it means for your decisions today, and the 3 highest-leverage things to do in the next 24–48 hours.

**The insight behind it:**
A founder making a term sheet decision at 36% recovery and 36ms HRV is not the same person as the same founder at 74% recovery and 50ms HRV. The delta is measurable. The cost is real. But almost no one is connecting real-time biometric data to the quality of executive decisions.

**What makes it different from a Whoop app:**
The Whoop app tells you your score. Bheem tells you what that score means for your specific life as a CEO — which decisions to defer, when to schedule your hardest conversation, and whether your gut feel today is trustworthy. It knows you're fundraising. It knows you travel. It adjusts the advice accordingly.

**Stack:**
- Whoop Developer API (OAuth2)
- Claude Code (Anthropic claude-sonnet-4-6)
- Claude Code Custom Skills system (`~/.claude/skills/Bheem/`)
- macOS shell for token management and API calls
- No database. No app. Runs in your terminal in 30 seconds.

**Who can use it:**
Any founder or executive with a Whoop device and a Claude Code subscription. Plug in your Whoop API credentials. Run `/Bheem`. Get your brief.

**Built:** April 2026 | **Status:** Daily use by the author | **Open to:** Anyone with Whoop + Claude Code

