└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### File Structure

```
~/.claude/
├── skills/
│   └── Bheem/
│       └── SKILL.md          ← The full coach prompt & logic
└── bheem/
    └── config.json           ← Whoop OAuth2 credentials & tokens
```

### Token Management

Whoop access tokens expire in ~1 hour. Bheem handles this automatically:

1. Attempt API call with stored `access_token`
2. If `401 Authorization was not valid` returned → trigger refresh
3. POST to `https://api.prod.whoop.com/oauth/oauth2/token` with `refresh_token`
4. Write new `access_token` and `refresh_token` to `config.json`
5. Retry API call

No manual re-authentication needed unless refresh token itself expires (typically 30–60 days).

