## 9. CUSTOMIZATION GUIDE

### Adjusting the State Thresholds

Default thresholds are based on Whoop's research. You can adjust:

```
🟢 GREEN:   67–100%  (high readiness)
🟡 YELLOW:  34–66%   (moderate — manage carefully)
🔴 RED:     0–33%    (protect mode)
```

If you're a professional athlete: raise the green threshold to 75+.
If you're 50+: consider the yellow zone to be 40–70% (HRV baselines decline with age).

### Adding Your Own Context

In the SKILL.md, the profile section accepts any founder-specific context:
- Industry/market (affects what "high stakes decision" means)
- Team size (affects what "route work" looks like)
- Current sprint (fundraising, product launch, team scaling)
- Travel calendar (so Bheem knows when to expect fatigue markers)

### Extending to Weekly Reviews

Run `/Bheem weekly` for a 7-day trend review with:
- Week rating (1–10)
- Pattern of the week (one key insight from 7-day data)
- Bottleneck (single biggest performance degrader)
- Win (one positive trend to reinforce)
- Top 3 structural changes for next week

